msgstr "Dateien, die ihre KI-Herkunft explizit deklarieren (IPTC DigitalSourceType, KI-Claim in C2PA, AIGC-Deklaration)."

#: admin/class-settings.php:573
msgid "Generator signatures"
msgstr "Generator-Signaturen"

#: admin/class-settings.php:586
msgid "Strong signals without a formal declaration (Stable Diffusion parameters, ComfyUI workflows, generator names in EXIF/XMP, camera-written C2PA)."
msgstr "Starke Signale ohne formale Deklaration (Stable-Diffusion-Parameter, ComfyUI-Workflows, Generator-Namen in EXIF/XMP, Kamera-geschriebenes C2PA)."

#: admin/class-settings.php:590
